          <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-text-primary">5. Privacy &amp; Data Protection</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Uncached is built with a <strong>100% Privacy &amp; Local First</strong> commitment:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
            <li>All filesystem scanning, file size computations, and cleanup commands are executed entirely on your local device.</li>
            <li>The Software contains zero analytics engines, zero telemetry trackers, and zero remote code uploads.</li>
